  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilience of Ethnic Tibetans (RESET) Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will work with Tibetan communities to support activities which preserve cultural traditions and promote sustainable development, education, and environmental conservation in Tibetan communities in the Tibet Autonomous Region and in other Tibetan communities in China.</narrative>
